Hi Jared,

I have the same issue when comparing output with JAGS and Distance (not unmarked, sorry Andy).
When I increased the upper bound of the uniform dist, the posterior distribution increased too.
I finally decided to set the upper bound as twice the raw encounter rate (number of individuals seen at each point/line) and I can get similar estimates with JAGS and Distance output.

Cheers,
Guillaume

